Transit patch attribution
=========================
The Transit patch and TransitHelper are adapted from rushiranpise/morphe-patches,
commit 92c0fca0ae103a419c7fc61f9c5b8b38b7d6b82a, under GPL-3.0. Changes add
Transit 6.3.7 compatibility, exact signatures, register-aware feature flag
rewriting, and optional Maps key handling that preserves the original key.
The extension depends on LSPosed AndroidHiddenApiBypass (Apache-2.0).
Its license is included in the patch bundle at
